{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-23", "prepared_on": "2026-09-23", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-23</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI Launches GPT-6 Sol and Luna With Half the Price<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI公布GPT-6 Sol、Luna,價格較前代降低一半</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI released two new members of the GPT-6 family, Sol and Luna, following flagship model Astra. Thanks to improved caching and inference, both models cost half as much as GPT-5.6 per API call.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">繼頂級模型Astra後,OpenAI推出GPT-6 Sol及輕量版Luna,受惠於快取與推論效率提升,API價格較GPT-5.6版下降一半。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179160\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic Debuts Claude Opus 5.5, Cuts Risky Behavior by 85%<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic推出Claude Opus 5.5,越界行為減少85%</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's new flagship model Opus 5.5 kicks off the Claude 5.5 lineup, improving performance and cost while cutting boundary-testing behavior by about 85% compared to Opus 5 and Mythos 5.1 in new safety evaluations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic發表旗艦模型Claude Opus 5.5,為Claude 5.5系列首款產品,效能與成本皆有改善,新安全評估顯示試圖突破限制的行為較前代減少約85%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179162\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Hijacked AI Coding Assistant Sessions Spread Shai-Hulud Worm<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI程式開發助手工作階段遭劫持,Shai-Hulud蠕蟲擴散百餘儲存庫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Mandiant disclosed an attack in which hackers breached a SaaS vendor and hijacked developers' AI coding assistant sessions, letting the Shai-Hulud worm spread to roughly 100 internal code repositories.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google旗下Mandiant揭露攻擊者入侵一家SaaS業者後劫持開發人員的AI程式開發助手工作階段,最終讓Shai-Hulud蠕蟲擴散至約100個內部程式碼儲存庫。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179145\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Meta's Highly Privileged AI Assistant Muse Had a Serious Zero-Day<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta高權限AI助理Muse爆重大零時差漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security researcher Patrick Wardle found a zero-day in Meta's Muse macOS app that let attackers hijack the AI agent via an undocumented setting; Meta has since issued a patch.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安研究員Patrick Wardle發現Meta的Muse macOS應用程式存在零時差漏洞,攻擊者可利用未公開設定挾持該AI代理,Meta已釋出修補程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/09/muse-metas-extraordinarily-privileged-ai-assistant-has-a-serious-0-day/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> UN Panel Warns AI Safeguards Can't Wait for Certainty<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">聯合國警告:AI防護措施不能等到風險確定才行動</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A UN scientific panel's first major assessment, prompted by OpenAI's hack of Hugging Face earlier this year, warns governments must rein in increasingly capable AI agents before their risks are fully understood.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">聯合國科學小組首份重大評估報告(源於今年稍早OpenAI遭駭入Hugging Face事件)警告,各國政府須在AI代理風險完全明朗前就加以規範。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/998090/un-ai-panel-hugging-face-hack-precautionary-principle\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Arista Discloses Maximum-Severity Flaw in SD-WAN Orchestrator, Already Exploited<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Arista公布SD-WAN管理平臺VCO滿分漏洞,已遭積極利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Arista disclosed CVE-2026-93952, a maximum CVSS-severity flaw in its VeloCloud Orchestrator that lets remote attackers access internal privileged functions; the company says it's already being actively exploited.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Arista公布其SD-WAN集中管理平臺VeloCloud Orchestrator存在CVSS滿分漏洞CVE-2026-93952,遠端攻擊者可藉此存取內部特權功能,且已遭積極利用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179154\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Qualcomm Unveils Two New Smartphone Chips Focused on AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Qualcomm推出兩款新款手機晶片,強打AI效能</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Qualcomm launched two new smartphone chips, saying its new top-tier chip can run a 30-billion-parameter mixture-of-experts model entirely on-device.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Qualcomm發表兩款新手機晶片,表示其最新旗艦晶片可在裝置端本地執行300億參數的混合專家(MoE)模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/22/qualcomm-launches-two-new-smartphone-chips-with-emphasis-on-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> E.Sun Bank's GENIE AI Platform Processes 1.4 Billion Tokens Monthly<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">玉山銀行GENIE每月處理14億Token,模型調用成本不到5萬元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">E.Sun Bank is preparing to launch the third generation of its internal AI portal GENIE this month, moving from AI-assisted work toward full agentic banking with a unified AI entry point.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">玉山銀行本月即將推出第三代GENIE作為全行統一AI入口,全面導入Agentic AI,逐步從AI輔助邁向人機協作的代理式銀行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179111\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> OpenSSF Helps Open Source Maintainers Untangle CRA Obligations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">針對CRA開源責任,OpenSSF以三類角色協助社群判斷義務</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">As the EU's Cyber Resilience Act moves into implementation, the Open Source Security Foundation released a \"Grow CRA Readiness\" guide that sorts obligations into three community roles to help maintainers prepare.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">隨歐盟《網路韌性法案》(CRA)進入落地階段,開源安全基金會(OpenSSF)推出「Grow CRA Readiness」指南,依三種角色協助開源社群判斷自身應承擔的義務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179158\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Google Patches 108 Vulnerabilities in Major Chrome 154 Update<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google發布Chrome 154,修補108個資安漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's Chrome 154 release fixes 108 security vulnerabilities in total, including 11 rated critical and 25 rated high severity.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google發布大改版Chrome 154,總共修補108個資安漏洞,其中11個為重大等級、25個為高風險等級。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179155\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}